supabase/.temp/

# Browser-automation scratch. The Playwright MCP server writes screenshots,
# page snapshots and console logs into its working directory, which is the
# repo root. One of those console logs reached 167 MB and was committed by
# accident, making the branch unpushable (GitHub rejects blobs over 100 MB).
.playwright-mcp/

# Agent worktrees. Each Claude session takes its own checkout here rather than
# sharing the repo root — two sessions on one HEAD interleave their commits
# onto whichever branch is current, which has already happened once. These are
# full working copies of the repo; committing one would duplicate the tree.
.claude/worktrees/

# Subagent-driven-development scratch: ledgers, task briefs, review packages,
# per-task reports. Local coordination state, superseded by git history and the
# tracked spec in docs/superpowers/ once a plan lands.
.superpowers/
